                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "This week, the House is voting on a $1 trillion cut to Medicaid which provides health coverage to 2 million North Carolinians.\n\nThis is a betrayal of the American people, and I hope a few Republicans show some courage and finally join us in stopping this outrageous budget scheme.",
