                "quoted_status_profile_username": null,
                "reply_count": 3,
                "retweet_count": 2,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "42% of children in North Carolina depend on Medicaid for health coverage.\n\nAs Republicans try to slash Medicaid, I will continue fighting to protect this support system which acts as a critical lifeline for so many Americans. #MedicaidMatters",
