                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "During National Nurses Week, we recognize all of the hardworking nurses in #NC04 and around the country.\n\nThank you for your tireless dedication to your patients and commitment to providing lifesaving care for all. https://t.co/RcelFm9eAt",
