                "retweet_count": 0,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I met with @AAMCtoday to discuss the essential role our medical institutions play in improving the health of patients and communities across North Carolina.\n\nWe must ensure @NIH and our medical colleges have the funding they need to continue delivering lifesaving research and care nationwide.",
