                "retweet_count": 1,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "The GOP is still trying to pass their tax package that will strip health care coverage from millions of Americans. \n\nOver 600,000 people in NC alone will lose their health insurance. I'll say it again: Trump's Big, Ugly Bill puts lives at risk.",
